# Pairs with ListedRestorable. A renewal extends a lease that has already run
# out, after a rebuild re-listed the backup; the delete then deletes the
# listed backup's artifacts under the revived lease.
MODULE: ListedRestorableRenewRevivesLapsed
TARGET: ListedRestorable
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: a renewal revives a lease that has run out
PERTURBS: DelRenew

--- FIND
    /\ seen' = [seen EXCEPT ![d] = lease[d]]
    /\ UNCHANGED <<row, man, pend, held, cap, ret, del, lease, art, gen, dgen>>
--- REPLACE
    \* MUTATION: a renewal revives a lease that has run out.
    /\ seen' = [seen EXCEPT ![d] = "live"]
    /\ lease' = [lease EXCEPT ![d] = "live"]
    /\ UNCHANGED <<row, man, pend, held, cap, ret, del, art, gen, dgen>>
--- END
